\item[S2] Mithun Kumar Das, Pramod Eyyunni and Bhuwanesh Rao Patil, \emph{Sparse subsets of the natural numbers and Euler\textquotesingle s totient function}, arXiv:1907.09847v2 (2020) Introduction, p. 3, statement before Theorem 1.6. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1907.09847}.
